WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
You type an address and press Enter.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.600
First the browser finds the computer
that holds the page.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.900
Then it asks that computer for the file.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.200
It reads the HTML and builds the page's parts.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.400
Then it styles them, lays them out and paints.
